    <item>
      <title>你的电脑要“活”了？OpenAI「AI智能体」炸场，ChatGPT不再“只会嘴炮”</title>
      <link>http://192.168.50.247:1313/insights/openaiaichatgpt-20250718014005889-0/</link>
      <pubDate>Fri, 18 Jul 2025 01:40:05 +0800</pubDate>
